# Senders file for the local compose example. One line per credential of a
# sending application: a key (name:pwk-sha256$..., made with
#   docker run --rm postwerk:dev gen-sender NAME
# which also prints the key, the application's SMTP password) or, as here,
# a password hash (name:pbkdf2-sha256$...). An optional policy line per
# sender: name:policy from=*@example.test max_per_minute=60
# See docs/configuration.md, "The senders file". The hash below is for the password
# "change-me-local-only"; never use it anywhere else.
# Create your own with:
#   printf '%s' 'your-password' | docker run --rm -i postwerk:dev hash-password
example-app:pbkdf2-sha256$600000$lvPOsqrr8g0XTIG8l5HnMw$4tEcWZH7y4soDvpuUwo1FDwLnWJ+jZaaGf8dvzQz8QM
